# Placement sees one free slot less on every machine than it has: a
# machine with exactly one free slot never takes a re-placed member. The
# heal oracle's "cell cannot hold shape" excuse counts free slots from the
# audit's own registry fold, so it must not excuse the journal.
excuse: heal: cell cannot hold shape
file: crates/lib/paros-model/src/placement.rs
--- find
        self.capacity.saturating_sub(self.booked)
--- replace
        self.capacity.saturating_sub(self.booked + 1)
--- end
